<title>BELGIUM: EU, Japan agree on '97 Japanese car exports.</title>
<headline>EU, Japan agree on '97 Japanese car exports.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union and Japan have agreed that Japan can ship 1,092,000 cars to the EU in 1997, a Commission spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The figure was agreed during regular consultations on a six-year-old agreement between the two sides to monitor Japanese car exports to the EU, spokesman Jochen Kubosch told a news briefing.</p>
</text>
